1. **Platform source code** in this repository — all rights reserved as above (proprietary unless founders publish otherwise).
2. **Educational content** (rewritten questions, explanations, Sensei cards) — owned by DSE Level Up; free to use on the official site; not for scraping / republishing as a competing bank.
3. **Third-party / trademarks** — “DSE” and HKEAA materials remain theirs. We do not claim official endorsement. Do not paste real exam PDFs into this repo.

